          </property>
          <property name="text">
           <string>This report is assembled on your computer. Nothing is sent automatically. When you choose a hand-off, MITK saves a .zip on your machine and opens your browser, mail program, or file manager so &lt;b&gt;you&lt;/b&gt; can send it. Review every item below before sharing. Logs, screenshots, and crash dumps can contain patient-related information (file paths, names, images, parts of the application's memory); include them only after checking that you may share them.</string>
